From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] v2 runner: one HtoD for the prepare_inputs index arrays

VLLM_GLM5_PROLOGUE_PACKED_H2D (default 0). idx_mapping, cu_num_logits and
query_start_loc are written into one pinned byte buffer, uploaded with one
copy into a fresh device buffer and handed out as views; query_start_loc's
segment is copied DtoD into the persistent (graph-addressed) buffer. 3 HtoD
+ 3 pin_memory() become 1 HtoD + 1 DtoD + 1 pinned allocation per step and
rank. Same bytes, so all model inputs are bit-identical. Adaptive
verification keeps the old path.

